lative maximum of $f(x).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and IV only\"." 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293885 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293886 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293887 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293888 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293889 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1041 "selection" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293886 13194139534541 true] [17592186293884 1110 #uuid "568c55d3-5794-53fc-a578-82d8ab32d9fa" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293885 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293885 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534541 true] [17592186293885 1111 #uuid "bdf3e699-bc6b-5488-9a35-7f0dad173e45" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293886 1034 "II and IV only" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293886 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534541 true] [17592186293886 1111 #uuid "9279ea72-feed-5421-993c-a268dffbef6b" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293887 1034 "I only" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534541 true] [17592186293887 1111 #uuid "8568e6fa-b37b-56c3-9072-5b4026280932" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293888 1034 "III only" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293888 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534541 true] [17592186293888 1111 #uuid "9bf42a90-a6b5-5cc5-8579-62ac39894a74" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293889 1034 "I, II, III, and IV" 13194139534541 true] [17592186293889 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534541 true] [17592186293889 1111 #uuid "7ddc6cc5-7a41-5fb6-8645-984c16b29111" 13194139534541 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-114414" 17592186293827 "q-114414/selection" 17592186293828 "q-114414/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" 17592186293829 "q-114414/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f